                           <fo:block>OSGi Specification repo for org.osgi.service.rest Release 1.0.1-SNAPSHOT</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" start-indent="1in" end-indent="0pt">
         <fo:block id="service.rest">
            <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
               <fo:block margin-left="0pt">
                  <fo:block font-size="24.8832pt" font-weight="bold">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                               space-before.optimum="0in"
                               space-before.minimum="0in"
                               space-before.maximum="0in"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               text-align="start"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-size="28pt"
                               line-height="35pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               space-after="24pt">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>137</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>REST Management Service Specification</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookcItalic"
                               font-size="18pt"
                               line-height="25pt">
                        <fo:basic-link internal-destination="org.osgi.service.rest">
                           <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                      font-family="inherit"
                                      letter-spacing="inherit"
                                      hyphenate="inherit">Version 1.0</fo:inline>
                        </fo:basic-link>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d61e88">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Introduction</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>137.1</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Introduction</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Cloud computing is a continuing trend in the IT industry. Due to its
    service model which embraces dynamism as opposed to masking it, OSGi
    appears to be an ideal base for building scalable and dependable
    applications for the cloud where changes in the deployment, network
    topology, and service availability are the norm rather than the exception.
    One of the possible scenarios for OSGi to be successfully applied to cloud
    computing is using it in a Platform as a Service (PaaS) spirit. Users
    write their bundles and can deploy them to a provided OSGi instance
    running in the cloud. This, however, requires the platform provider to
    expose the OSGi management API to the end user and make them available
    through a network protocol. One of the popular approaches in cloud
    computing to remote communication is the use of RESTful web
    services.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Representational State Transfer (REST) is the architectural style of
    the world wide web. It can be described as a set of constraints that
    govern the interactions between the main components of the Internet.
    Recently, REST style interaction has gained popularity as a architecture
    for web services (RESTful web services), mainly to overcome the perceived
    complexity and verbosity of SOAP-based web services. This specification
    describes a REST interface for framework management, client-side Java and
    JavaScript APIs, and an extension mechanism through which other bundles
    can contribute their own RESTful management APIs and make them
    discoverable by clients.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e92">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.1.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Essentials</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d61e94">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e95">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Client-Server</fo:inline> - A separation of concern
          between the entity responsible for the user-interaction (client) and
          the other entity (server) responsible for data storage. For
          instance, in the original world wide web the browser is the client
          rendering and presenting the content delivered by one or more web
          servers. As a result, web content becomes more portable and content
          providers more scalable.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e99">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stateless</fo:inline> - State is entirely kept at the
          client side. Therefore, every request must contain all state
          required for the server to accomplish the transaction and deliver
          content. The main rationale behind this design constraint is to
          again improve the scalability since in a pure stateless design the
          server resources are not burdened with maintaining any client state.
          Another perceived advantage is that the failure models of stateless
          interactions is simpler and fault tolerance easier to
          achieve.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e103">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Cacheable</fo:inline> - Content marked as cacheable
          can be temporarily stored and used to immediately answer future
          equivalent requests and improve efficiency and reduce network
          utilization and access latencies. Due to the end-to-end principle,
          caches can be placed where necessary, e.g., at the client
          (forward-proxy), at the server side (backward-proxy), or somewhere
          in-between for example in a content delivery network. Content marked
          as non-cacheable must be freshly retrieved with every request even
          in the presence of caches.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e107">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Layered</fo:inline> - Layering introduces natural
          boundaries to coupling since every layer only accesses the services
          provided by the lower layer and provides services to the next higher
          layer.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e111">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Uniform Interface</fo:inline> - Generality of
          component interfaces provides a natural decoupling of implementation
          and interface. REST furthermore encourages the separation of
          identifiable resources (addressing) and their representation
          (content delivery).</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e115">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.1.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Entities</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d61e117">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e118">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Resource</fo:inline> - A resource is an abstract
          piece of information that can be addressed by a resource identifier.
          The mapping of a resource to a concrete set of entities can vary
          over time.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e122">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Representation</fo:inline> - A representation is a
          sequence of bytes plus associated meta-data that describe the state
          of a resource. The data format of a representation is called the
          media-type. Every concrete representation of a resource is just one
          of arbitrarily many possible representations. The selection of a
          concrete representation of a resource can be made according to the
          media types supported by both the client and the server.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e126">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">REST Management Service</fo:inline> - The management
          service exposes a REST API for remotely managing an OSGi framework
          through the network in a lightweight and portable fashion.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d61e130">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Client</fo:inline> - The client is a machine using
          the management service by issuing REST requests through the network.
          It can do so either directly or indirectly, i.e., through
          client-side libraries using the REST calls internally.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e134">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.1.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Synopsis</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The manageable entities of an OSGi framework are mapped to
      resources accessible through resource identifiers. These identifiers are
      relative to the (usually externally accessible) root URL of the
      management service. Clients can either discover this root URL or receive
      it through configuration. Subsequently, a client is able to introspect
      the state of the framework and perform management operations.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The internal state of a framework resource is expressed and
      transmitted as a representation. The format of the representation is
      subject to a mutual agreement between client and management service
      regarding media types commonly supported by both endpoints. This
      specification describes two representation formats: JSON and XML.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d61e138">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Interacting with the REST Management Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>137.2</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Interacting with the REST Management Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The REST Management Service is not a traditional OSGi service and it
    does not appear in the service registry. Its purpose is to expose a
    management interface to clients which can perform operations on the
    framework through a network connection. Therefore, it is ideally suited
    for situations where the user of an OSGi framework does not have direct
    access to the machine it is running on, a typical situation in
    Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) or Platform as a Service (PaaS).
    However, even in other domains having a lightweight and easily accessible
    management solution can be of benefit, e.g., for embedded devices. The
    advantage of REST is that it uses HTTP and therefore does usually not
    interfere with firewalls. Furthermore, the REST format is easily
    embeddable into client-side scripting technologies like JavaScript and can
    be consumed in web browsers.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Much of the value of the REST Management Service lies in client-side
    libraries which can use the REST protocol and interact with the OSGi
    framework through the Management Service. Therefore, this specification
    contains API for two clients, a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.rest.client">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">Java Client API</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> and a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="service.rest-javascript.api">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">JavaScript Client API</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.rest-resource.identifiers">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.2.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Resource Identifier Overview</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The REST Management Service comprises of a set of resources that
      can be retrieved and in some cases also modified through REST requests.
      These resources need to be made available under well-defined paths so
      that clients can interact with them. As the initial entry point a client
      receives a URL to the REST Management Service. This can be done, e.g.,
      as part of the creation of a cloud-based OSGi framework, and the precise
      mechanism would be proprietary to the cloud platform used. Relative to
      this URL the client can access the resources through the following
      resource identifiers:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d61e152">framework
framework/state
framework/startlevel
framework/bundles

framework/bundles/representations

framework/bundle/{bundleid}
framework/bundle/{bundleid}/state
framework/bundle/{bundleid}/startlevel
framework/bundle/{bundleid}/header
framework/services

framework/services/representations

framework/service/{serviceid}</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundle/0/state</fo:inline> is an alias for
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/state</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Extensions to the REST Management Service can be discovered by
      visiting the Extensions Resource at:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         wrap-option="no-wrap"
                         white-space-collapse="false"
                         white-space-treatment="preserve"
                         linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                         text-align="start"
                         font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         letter-spacing="-.0em"
                         space-before="5pt"
                         space-after="3pt"
                         space-after.conditionality="retain"
                         start-indent="inherit"
                         line-height="11pt"
                         id="d61e158">extensions</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">For more details on the extension mechanism see <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.rest-extensions">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Extending the REST Management Service</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-extensions"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.rest-resource.filters">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.2.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Filtering Results</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">bundles</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">bundles/representations</fo:inline>,
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">services</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">services/representations</fo:inline>
      resources allow the use of a query parameter which specifies a filter to
      restrict the result set. The filter expression follows the Core
      Specifications <fo:inline font-style="italic">Framework Filter Syntax</fo:inline>; see <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.rest-corefilter">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">Framework Filter Syntax</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Filters on services are matched against the service attributes.
      The query parameter is of the form:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/services?filter=ldap-filter</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Filters on bundles are matched against the attributes of
      capabilities in the respective namespaces. Filters on bundles have the
      form:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundles?namespace1=ldap-filter1&amp;namespace2=ldap-filter2&amp;...</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If multiple capabilities for a given namespace are present, then a
      filter succeeds when one of these capabilities matches. When multiple
      filter expressions across namespaces are given, these are combined with
      the <fo:inline font-style="italic">and</fo:inline> operator.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e189">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.2.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Content Type Matching</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Resources can present themselves through different representation
      variants. An implementation of this specification must support at least
      the JSON representation and the XML representation of resources. Clients
      can support a subset of representations. Matching the clients
      capabilities to understand certain representation formats with the
      servers supported formats follows the typical HTTP pattern of content
      negotiation and requires the client to set corresponding HTTP Accept
      headers for supported formats in the form of their media types. This
      specification describes the format and media types for representations
      in JSON and XML format in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.rest-representation">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Representations</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-representation"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Implementations of the REST Management Service offering different
      variants of representations must return the best matching variant based
      on the HTTP accept header. In addition, they must respect the file
      extensions defined for the different media types as specified in the
      respective IETF RFC (e.g., ".xml" as specified in IETF RFC 3032 and
      ".json" as specified in IETF RFC 4627). If a file extension is appended
      to the resource, an implementation must return the variant mandated by
      the file extension provided that it supports this content type.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d61e196">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Resources</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>137.3</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Resources</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The framework and its state is mapped to a set of different
    resources. Each resource is accessible through a resource identifier, as
    summarized in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="service.rest-resource.identifiers">
                  <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">
                     <fo:inline font-style="italic">Resource Identifier Overview</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-resource.identifiers"/>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e202">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Framework Startlevel Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/startlevel</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The startlevel resource represents the active start level of the
      framework. It supports the GET and PUT requests.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e207">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.1.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-framework.startlevel.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Framework Startlevel Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e213">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e214">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a startlevel representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e216">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e218">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.1.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>PUT</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The PUT request sets the target framework startlevel. The body
        of the request needs to be a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-framework.startlevel.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Framework Startlevel Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. The request can return the following status
        codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e224">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e225">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>204 (NO CONTENT): the request was received and valid. The
            framework will asynchronously start to adjust the framework
            startlevel until the target startlevel has been reached.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e227">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>415 (UNSUPPORTED MEDIA TYPE): the request had a media type
            that is not supported by the REST management service.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e229">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received an
            IllegalArgumentException when trying to adjust the framework
            startlevel, e.g., because the requested startlevel was zero or
            negative.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e231">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundles Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundles</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The bundles resource represents the list of all bundles installed
      on the managed framework. It supports the GET request and two
      syntactically different forms of POST requests which are used to install
      new bundles to the framework.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Results for this resource can be filtered as described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.rest-resource.filters">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Filtering Results</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-resource.filters"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e240">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.2.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.list.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle List Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e246">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e247">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle list representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e249">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.rest-bundles.post.location">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.2.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>POST with Location String</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The POST request installs a new bundle to the managed framework
        and thereby logically appends it to the bundles resource. The new
        bundle to be installed is referenced by a location string which is
        passed as the body of the request. In order to disambiguate the
        request from the other form of POST, the content type must be set to
        text/plain. In practice, the location string is usually a URL. Since
        the framework will use the location retrieving the physical bundle, it
        needs to be accessible from the remotely managed framework and not
        necessarily from the managing client.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The management service implementation must check if the result
        of the install request matches the requested bundle since the OSGi
        framework will return an existing bundle object as the return value of
        an install call if there was already one with the same location string
        installed. One way of doing it is comparing the last modification
        timestamp. A detected collision is indicated to the requesting clients
        through an error code 409.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        of the newly installed bundle. The following status codes can be
        returned:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e259">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e260">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the bundle has been successfully installed and the
            body of the response contains a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e265">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to install. The body of the message is
            a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the
            installation did not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e270">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>409 (CONFLICT): there is already a bundle installed with the
            same location string.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.rest-bundles.post.bundle">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.2.3</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>POST with Bundle</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">This variant of the POST request uploads the bundle as the body
        of the request. The media type of the request should be set to
        application/vnd.osgi.bundle which must be supported by all REST
        management services. Implementations are free to accept other media
        types for this request with the exception of text/plain. For instance,
        they can opt to additionally support application/zip or
        application/x-jar.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">Clients should use the HTTP Content-Location field to set a
        bundle location. If no content location is given, REST management
        service implementations must generate a unique location string in
        order to avoid unintended collisions between unrelated bundles.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        of the newly installed bundle. The following status codes can be
        returned:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e280">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e281">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the bundle has been successfully installed and the
            body of the response contains the URI.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e283">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to install. The body of the message is
            a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the
            installation did not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e288">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>409 (CONFLICT): there is already a bundle installed with the
            same location string.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e290">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundles Representations Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundles/representations</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e294">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.3.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET of the Representations</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">bundles</fo:inline> resource returns a list of the URIs of
        all bundles installed on the framework. For clients interested in the
        details of multiple bundles there is also the possibility to retrieve
        the bundle representation of each installed bundle with a single
        request through the <fo:inline font-style="italic">bundles/representations</fo:inline>
        resource.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representations.list.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representations List Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. The request can return the following status
        codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">Results for this resource can be filtered as described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-resource.filters">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Filtering Results</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-resource.filters"/>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e310">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e311">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle list representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e313">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e315">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundle Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundle/{bundleid}</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The bundle resource represents a single, distinct bundle in the
      system. Hence, it has to be qualified by a bundle id. The resource
      supports the GET, two variants of PUT, and the DELETE requests.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e320">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.4.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        from the REST management service. The request can return the following
        status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e326">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e327">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e329">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e331">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e333">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.4.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>PUT with Location String</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The PUT request updates the bundle with a new version,
        referenced by a location string which is passed as the body of the
        request. In order to disambiguate the request from the other form of
        PUT, the content type must be set to text/plain. The same rationale
        applies as for <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundles.post.location">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">POST with Location String</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundles.post.bundle">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">POST with Bundle</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-bundles.post.bundle"/>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>, if a location string is
        given it must point to a location reachable by the managed framework.
        If no location string is passed as the body of the request, the
        framework will perform an update based on the existing bundle's
        location string.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        of the updated bundle. The following status codes can be
        returned:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e345">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e346">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>204 (NO CONTENT): the request was received and valid and the
            framework has issued the update.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e348">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to update. The body of the message is
            a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the update did
            not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e353">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e355">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.4.3</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>PUT with Bundle</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The PUT request updates the bundle with a new version, uploaded
        as the body of the request. The media type of the request should be
        set to application/vnd.osgi.bundle which must be supported by all REST
        management services. Implementations are free to accept other media
        types for this request with the exception of text/plain. For instance,
        they can opt to additionally support application/zip or
        application/x-jar.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        of the updated bundle. The following status codes can be
        returned:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e362">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e363">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>204 (NO CONTENT): the request was received and valid and the
            framework has issued the update.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e365">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to update. The body of the message is
            a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the update did
            not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e370">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e372">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.4.4</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>DELETE</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The DELETE request uninstalls the bundle from the
        framework.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The body of the response is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        of the uninstalled bundle, where the bundle state will be UNINSTALLED.
        The following status codes can be returned:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e379">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e380">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>204 (NO CONTENT): the request was received and valid and the
            framework has uninstalled the bundle.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e382">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to uninstall. The body of the message
            is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the
            uninstallation did not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e387">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e389">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundle State Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundle/{bundleid}/state</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The bundle state resource represents the internal state of an
      installed bundle qualified through its bundle id. It supports the GET
      and PUT requests.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e394">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.5.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.state.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle State Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e400">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e401">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle state representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e403">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e405">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e407">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.5.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>PUT</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The PUT request sets the target state for the given bundle. This
        can, e.g., be state=32 for transitioning the bundle to started, or
        state=4 for stopping the bundle and transitioning it to resolved. The
        body of the request needs to be a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.state.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle State Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. Not all state transitions are valid. The
        body of the response is the new <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.state.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle State Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. The request can return the following status
        codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e415">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e416">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request was received and valid. The framework
            has performed a state change and the new bundle state is contained
            in the body.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e418">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the REST management service received a
            BundleException when trying to perform the state transition. The
            body of the message is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the operation
            did not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e423">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>402 (PRECONDITION FAILED): the requested target state is not
            reachable from the current bundle state or is not a target state.
            An example such state is the STOPPING state.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e425">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e427">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>415 (UNSUPPORTED MEDIA TYPE): the request had a media type
            that is not supported by the REST management service.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e429">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundle Header Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundle/{bundleid}/header</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The bundle header resource represents manifest header of a bundle
      which is qualified by its bundle id. It can only be read through a GET
      request.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e434">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.6.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.header.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Header Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The raw
        header value is used unless an <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">Accept-Language</fo:inline> header is
        set on the HTTP request. If multiple accepted languages are set only
        the first is used to localize the header. The request can return the
        following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e442">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e443">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle header representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e445">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e447">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e449">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.7</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Bundle Startlevel Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/bundle/{bundleid}/startlevel</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The bundle startlevel resource represents the start level of the
      bundle qualified by its bundle id. It supports the GET and PUT
      requests.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e454">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.7.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.startlevel.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Startlevel Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e460">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e461">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a bundle startlevel representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e463">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e465">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e467">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.7.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>PUT</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The PUT request sets the target bundle startlevel. The body of
        the request needs to be a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.startlevel.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Startlevel Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>, however only the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">startLevel</fo:inline>
        property is used. The request can return the following status
        codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e475">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e476">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request was received and valid. The REST
            management service has changed the bundle startlevel according to
            the target value. The body of the response is the new bundle
            startlevel representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e478">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): either the target startlevel state
            involved invalid values, e.g., a startlevel smaller or equal to
            zero and the REST management service got an
            IllegalArgumentException, or the REST management service received
            a BundleException when trying to perform the startlevel change. In
            the latter case, the body of the message is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.rest-bundle.exception.representation">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">
                                       <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bundle Exception Representation</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> describing the reason why the operation
            did not succeed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e483">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not bundle with the given bundle
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e485">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>415 (UNSUPPORTED MEDIA TYPE): the request had a media type
            that is not supported by the REST management service.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e487">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.8</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Services Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/services</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The services resource represents the set of all services available
      on the framework, optionally constrained by a filter expression. It is
      read-only and therefore only supports the GET request.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Results for this resource can be filtered as described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.rest-resource.filters">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Filtering Results</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-resource.filters"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e496">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.8.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-service.list.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Service List Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e502">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e503">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a service list representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e505">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the provided filter expression was not
            valid.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e507">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e509">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.9</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Services Representations Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/services/representations</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e513">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.9.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET of the Representations</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The services resource returns a list of the URIs of all services
        registered on the framework. For clients interested in the details of
        multiple services there is also the possibility to retrieve the
        service representation of each available service with a single request
        through the <fo:inline font-style="italic">services/representations</fo:inline> resource.
        The body of the response is a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-service.representations.list.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Service Representations List Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from the REST management service. The
        request can return the following status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">Results for this resource can be filtered as described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-resource.filters">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Filtering Results</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.rest-resource.filters"/>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e525">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e526">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a service list representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e528">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>400 (BAD REQUEST): the provided filter expression was not
            valid.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e530">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d61e533">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>137.3.10</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Service Resource</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">framework/service/{serviceid}</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The service resource represents a single, distinct service in the
      framework. Hence, it has to be qualified by a service id. Services can
      only be read through the REST Management Service and therefore only
      support the GET request.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e538">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>137.3.10.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>GET</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The GET request retrieves a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.rest-service.representation">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Service Representation</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> . The request can return the following
        status codes:</fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d61e544">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e545">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>200 (OK): the request has been served successfully and the
            body of the response is a service representation.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e547">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>404 (NOT FOUND): there is not service with the given service
            id.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d61e549">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>406 (NOT ACCEPTABLE): the REST management service does not
            support any of the requested representations.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
