               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">An implementation of this specification must provide the <fo:inline color="inherit"
                             font-family="inherit"
                             letter-spacing="inherit"
                             hyphenate="inherit">
                     <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">osgi.implementation</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
      capability with name <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">osgi.rest</fo:inline>. This capability can be used
      by provisioning tools and during resolution to ensure that a REST
      Management implementation is present to handle REST requests defined in
      this specification. The capability must also declare a uses constraint
      on the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">org.osgi.service.rest</fo:inline> package:</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
