               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Objects implementing this signature are provided by users of the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">OSGiRestClient</fo:inline> as callbacks. One of the callback functions is
    invoked on completion of a REST invocation.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="d61e1773">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
